# Every non-comment, non-blank line is text the failure diagnostic must contain.
# A reifying triple `<< s p o >>` desugars to a `rdf:reifies <<( s p o )>>`
# triple at parse time, so it is caught by the same triple-term check as the
# explicit `<<( ... )>>` spelling — the diagnostic names both spellings.
native-sparql-query-eval
reifying triple
1.2-basic
